{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-115","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-115-talk-403816580-line","text":"在喧哗的星际百货大楼，一台扭蛋机做作地出现在你的面前。炫彩的灯光，撕心裂肺的音乐和满身的鞋印，足以证明它在这里的受欢迎程度。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-115-talk-403816581-line","text":"「博识学会联名限定版扭蛋，你，值得拥有。」真有人想要这种东西？你把头凑到扭蛋机上，想看看有没有熟人的周边产品。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-115-talk-403816582-line","text":"「要不，来两下试试水？」扭蛋机一语道出你的心声。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-115-text-16597175819054148068-choice","text":"玩的就是一个刺激。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-115-text-16522073240195360112-choice","text":"就当照顾学会的生意。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-115-text-347307584445858792-choice","text":"离开。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-115-text-17278767016848671934-effect","text":"选择离开。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-115-talk-403816583-line","text":"好吧，你认识的学士加起来两只手都能数清，实在没有为它消费的必要。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-115-talk-403816584-line","text":"扪心自问，这真不是假面愚者的陷阱？","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-115-talk-403816585-line","text":"学会放弃沉没成本的瞬间，你已经比学会一半的人都要聪明了。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"}]}
